# OS
.DS_Store

# npm (devDependencies only — serve, markdownlint-cli2; no build step for the site)
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# AI Tool Symlinks: CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, GEMINI.md, .cursorrules, .claude/skills,
# .claude/agents, .claude/settings.json, .augment/* are all COMMITTED symlinks into
# .ai/ (source of truth). Even though npm exists now, `npm install` is not
# guaranteed to run before someone opens Claude Code in this repo, so committing
# the symlinks themselves (rather than generating them via a postinstall hook) is
# what guarantees Superpowers + repo hooks are active on a plain `git clone` alone.
# Do NOT gitignore them. `npm install`'s postinstall re-runs the setup script as a
# convenience self-heal, on top of — not instead of — the committed symlinks.
# Only the personal, machine-specific files below are local-only:
.claude/settings.local.json

# Local-only personal files (copied into worktrees from main by setup-ai-symlinks.sh)
.ai/session-history/
